  "content": {
    "title": "Season 2 Episode List - The Pitt (TV Series) Guide - IGN",
    "text": "After an award-winning first season, The Pitt launched into season 2 in early January alongside the news that HBO had already greenlit the series for a season 3. Similar to season 1, each episode represents one hour of a 15-hour shift at the hospital. Season 2 is centered around Dr. Robby's last shift right before a planned three-month sabbatical and takes place on July 4, 2026. In IGN's review of the premiere, we praised the series for sticking to it's guns, saying: \"If you enjoyed The Pitt in Season 1, there’s absolutely no reason you won’t be on board with Season 2. The new season follows that same, proven formula, with only the addition of Sepideh Moafi’s Dr. Baran Al-Hashimi serving to shake up the mix.\" All Season 2 EpisodesNew episodes of The Pitt air on HBO Max every Thursday starting at 6 p.m. ET. There have been eight episodes released so far and season 2 is currently set to end on April 16, 2026. Episode # Title Directed by Written by Release Date Watched? 1 \"7:00 A.M.\"John Wells R. Scott Gemmill January 8, 2026 Episode 12 \"8:00 A.M.\"Damian Marcano Joe Sachs & R. Scott Gemmill January 15, 2026 Episode 23 \"9:00 A.M.\"Uta Briesewitz Noah Wyle January 22, 2026 Episode 34 \"10:00 A.M.\"John Cameron Cynthia Adarkwa January 29, 2026 Episode 45 \"11:00 A.M.\"Damian Marcano Simran Baidwan February 5, 2026 Episode 56 \"12:00 P.M.\"Noah Wyle Valerie Chu February 12, 2026 Episode 67 \"1:00 P.M.\"Uta Briesewitz Kirsten Pierre-Geyfman & R. Scott Gemmill February 19, 2026 Episode 78 \"2:00 P.M.\"John Cameron Joe Sachs February 26, 2026 Episode 89 \"3:00 P.M.\"Shawn Hatosy Cynthia Adarkwa March 5, 2026 Episode 910 \"4:00 P.M.\"Damian Marcano Simran Baidwan March 12, 2026 Episode 1011 \"5:00 P.M.\"Uta Briesewitz Valerie Chu March 19, 2026 Episode 1112 \"6:00 P.M.\" TBA Danny Hogan & R. Scott Gemmill March 26, 2026 Episode 1213 \"7:00 P.M.\" TBA Joe Sachs April 2, 2026 Episode 1314 \"8:00 P.M.\" TBA Noah Wyle April 9, 2026 Episode 1415 \"9:00 P.M.\" TBA R. Scott Gemmill April 16, 2026 Episode 15Was this guide helpful?In This Guide",
